  "input": "What is the deploy window for reporting?\n[2026-06-01] standup/ember/2026-06-01: For newcomers: the deploy window for the reporting service is still on Tuesdays and Thursdays between 10:00 and 12:00 UTC. [2025-09-03] standup/cinder/2025-09-03: New deploy window for the product catalog: on weekdays between 08:00 and 10:00 UTC, never on Fridays. Forget the previous Mon-Thu 09:00-17:00 UTC slot. [2025-08-25] standup/atlas/2025-08-25: New deploy window for Ledger: on Wednesdays between 09:00 and 11:00 UTC. Forget the previous weekday mornings before 11:00 UTC slot.",
